# RodzEdu conventions

- Stack: Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, React Compiler.
- Keep app code under `src/app/`. Prefer Server Components; add `"use client"` only when needed.
- Before finishing a change that touches app code, run `npm run lint` and `npm run build`.
- Do not commit secrets, `.env*`, `.vercel/`, `node_modules/`, or `.next/`.
- When using Next.js APIs, check `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` for this repo's installed version.
